<section class="narrow article page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</span><h1>Your information</h1><p>SchemePath stores account details and profile attributes you choose to provide, such as age, income, state, occupation, and optional sensitive attributes. These values are used only to compare your profile with catalogue rules and to preserve your own assessment history.</p><h2>Access and retention</h2><p>Profile information is private to your account and administrators do not need it to manage the catalogue. Passwords are stored as one-way hashes. Assessment records contain a profile snapshot so the past result can be explained; deleting your account removes its profile, bookmarks, and assessment history. Administrative audit events may remain without personal profile details.</p><h2>Limitations</h2><p>This is a local educational project, not a government service. No email verification, password recovery email, third-party analytics, or document upload is enabled. Do not enter information you do not want stored in a local database. Back up and protect the database according to your own needs.</p><p>Do not claim this project complies with a specific privacy law; no legal compliance review has been performed.</p></section>
